      "description": "Two spring hangers on one span. Nodes N1..N7 at x = 0, 2, ..., 12 m; S-1 (N1) and S-7 (N7) rigid UZ; G-1 (N1: UX, UY, RX), G-7 (N7: UY). SH-3 at N3 (x = 4): k = 120000 N/m, cold load 5000 N; SH-5 at N5 (x = 8): k = 200000 N/m, cold load 7500 N. Stored loads F-1 -6000 N at N2, F-2 -9000 N at N4, F-3 -4000 N at N6. Closed form: the two hanger equations u_i + sum_j f_ij k_j u_j = sum_l f_il F_l + sum_j f_ij (F_cold,j + k_j g_j) for the simply supported 12 m span, solved by Cramer's rule.",
